{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 2, "text": "落、鸡平部落、战洞部落、罗母株部落、石人部落等八部落分支”①。其地域在今贵州的安", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 242, "w": 1544, "h": 73}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "落、鸡平部落、战洞部落、罗母株部落、石人部落等八部落分支”①。其地域在今贵州的安", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 242, "w": 1544, "h": 73}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 3, "text": "龙、罗甸、册享、兴义、镇宁及贵阳等县、市，与目前布依族的聚居地域分布状况一致。“西", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 318, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "龙、罗甸、册享、兴义、镇宁及贵阳等县、市，与目前布依族的聚居地域分布状况一致。“西", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 318, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 4, "text": "南蕃中部族数十，独五姓最著。”所称五姓，即龙、罗、石、方、张等“五蕃”，后来增加韦、程", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 378, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "南蕃中部族数十，独五姓最著。”所称五姓，即龙、罗、石、方、张等“五蕃”，后来增加韦、程", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 378, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 5, "text": "二蕃，称为“七蕃”。到元代又增加卢蕃，统称“八蕃”，领地在今贵州惠水、长顺一带。元", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 443, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "二蕃，称为“七蕃”。到元代又增加卢蕃，统称“八蕃”，领地在今贵州惠水、长顺一带。元", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 443, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 6, "text": "世祖至元十六年（1279年）置“八蕃宣慰司统其地”。“八蕃”是布依族地区的地方政权，", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 507, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "世祖至元十六年（1279年）置“八蕃宣慰司统其地”。“八蕃”是布依族地区的地方政权，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 507, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 7, "text": "其首领中如卢、罗、韦等姓氏，至今还是布依族中人口众多的大姓。“蕃”古读“博”［po”］，", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 571, "w": 1548, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "其首领中如卢、罗、韦等姓氏，至今还是布依族中人口众多的大姓。“蕃”古读“博”［po”］，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 571, "w": 1548, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 8, "text": "与布依族称“人”、“族”的发音“濮”相近，故此读音应当源自于布依语。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 640, "w": 1230, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "与布依族称“人”、“族”的发音“濮”相近，故此读音应当源自于布依语。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 640, "w": 1230, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 9, "text": "元代布依族，以“仲家”之称见于史籍。明、清汉文史籍对布依族的称谓有“仲苗”、", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 704, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "元代布依族，以“仲家”之称见于史籍。明、清汉文史籍对布依族的称谓有“仲苗”、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 704, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 10, "text": "“仲蛮”", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 768, "w": 145, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "“仲蛮”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 768, "w": 145, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 11, "text": "、“青仲”或“仲家”。从清代到民国时期，布依族除被称为“仲家”外，尚有“夷", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 764, "w": 1411, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "、“青仲”或“仲家”。从清代到民国时期，布依族除被称为“仲家”外，尚有“夷", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 764, "w": 1411, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 12, "text": "家”、“夷族”、“水家”、“水户”", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 833, "w": 523, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "家”、“夷族”、“水家”、“水户”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 833, "w": 523, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 13, "text": "、“土边”、“土人”、“本地”、“沙人”等。有的带有侮辱性，力", "bbox_px": {"x": 599, "y": 833, "w": 1029, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "、“土边”、“土人”、“本地”、“沙人”等。有的带有侮辱性，力", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 599, "y": 833, "w": 1029, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 14, "text": "布依族群众所反感。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 893, "w": 354, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族群众所反感。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 893, "w": 354, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 15, "text": "在历史发展过程中，布依族中还融入了部分汉族成员。尤其是明、清两代，朝廷派遣", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 966, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在历史发展过程中，布依族中还融入了部分汉族成员。尤其是明、清两代，朝廷派遣", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 966, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 16, "text": "大批汉族军队人黔屯军，不少人与当地布依族结婚，融合到布依族中。布依族中流传的", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1030, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "大批汉族军队人黔屯军，不少人与当地布依族结婚，融合到布依族中。布依族中流传的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1030, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 17, "text": "所谓明洪武年间“调北征南”或“调北填南”，由江西吉安府或湖广迁来的说法，反映了部", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1090, "w": 1540, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "所谓明洪武年间“调北征南”或“调北填南”，由江西吉安府或湖广迁来的说法，反映了部", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1090, "w": 1540, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 18, "text": "分史实，但绝大多数是为了避免民族歧视，与同一姓氏的汉族认“家门”（宗族）杜撰出来", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1155, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "分史实，但绝大多数是为了避免民族歧视，与同一姓氏的汉族认“家门”（宗族）杜撰出来", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1155, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 19, "text": "的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1223, "w": 64, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1223, "w": 64, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 20, "text": "在布依族人民的思想意识和祖先崇拜仪式里，他们均以原住民族自居，称汉族为“客", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1283, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在布依族人民的思想意识和祖先崇拜仪式里，他们均以原住民族自居，称汉族为“客", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1283, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 21, "text": "家”、“客户”，自称为“本地人”。农历正月初一到初三，家家户户都要举行迎送祖先的活", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1348, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家”、“客户”，自称为“本地人”。农历正月初一到初三，家家户户都要举行迎送祖先的活", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1348, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 22, "text": "动。在老人过世的超度仪式上，其世代相传的送祖路线有“达罕、蛮路、拉少、林上、歌告、", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1416, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "动。在老人过世的超度仪式上，其世代相传的送祖路线有“达罕、蛮路、拉少、林上、歌告、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1416, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 23, "text": "善书、珉谷、阿娄、刚旁、波定”等许多地名。珉谷即今之贞丰；达罕、蛮路、拉少、林上在北", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1481, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "善书、珉谷、阿娄、刚旁、波定”等许多地名。珉谷即今之贞丰；达罕、蛮路、拉少、林上在北", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1481, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 24, "text": "盘江附近；阿娄、刚旁、波定在今之镇宁、安顺。贵阳市一带的布依族在办丧事时，引魂幡", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1545, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "盘江附近；阿娄、刚旁、波定在今之镇宁、安顺。贵阳市一带的布依族在办丧事时，引魂幡", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1545, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 25, "text": "上都要写“矩州”或“黔州”字样。“矩州”、“黔州”即今之黔中地区。布依族认为这些地", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1605, "w": 1540, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "上都要写“矩州”或“黔州”字样。“矩州”、“黔州”即今之黔中地区。布依族认为这些地", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1605, "w": 1540, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 26, "text": "方是老祖宗的原籍。因此，从“夷越”—“夷僚”—“蕃蛮”—“仲家”；从“有肩石斧”", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1670, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "方是老祖宗的原籍。因此，从“夷越”—“夷僚”—“蕃蛮”—“仲家”；从“有肩石斧”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1670, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 27, "text": "、“有", "bbox_px": {"x": 1540, "y": 1670, "w": 84, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "、“有", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 1540, "y": 1670, "w": 84, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 32, "line_no": 28, "text": "段石锛”、“几何印纹陶”到“青铜钺”、“饰有翔鹭、羽人竞渡的铜鼓”，布依族族源的历史", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1734, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "段石锛”、“几何印纹陶”到“青铜钺”、“饰有翔鹭、羽人竞渡的铜鼓”，布依族族源的历史", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1734, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
